Title: Warehouse Fog

INT. RIVERSIDE WAREHOUSE - NIGHT

MARA, 30s, crosses the empty floor. A phone rings beside a metal crate.

MARA
I left the keys in the car.

She picks up the phone. Through the high windows, fog presses against the glass.

EXT. RIVERSIDE WAREHOUSE - DAWN

MARA steps outside with the letter in her hand. The first light reaches the loading bay.
